Package: thipR
Title: Read-Only R Access to THIP Notebook Databases
Version: 0.2.1.9000
Authors@R: person("Songyos", "Rajborirug", email = "songyos.r@psu.ac.th",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A small connection and discovery layer over 'DBI',
    'ClickHouseHTTP' and 'dbplyr' for THIP notebook users. Applies read-only
    request settings and configurable limits, provides lazy multi-table access,
    and supports metadata discovery without embedding platform credentials.
    Flags user-defined ICD code sets using exact or prefix matching, with
    sparse matrices for local data and lazy read-only filtering for ClickHouse
    tables. Retrieves person-specific date windows in complete batches.
    Does not supply clinical definitions.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports: ClickHouseHTTP (>= 1.1.2), DBI, dbplyr (>= 2.0.0), dplyr,
    methods, utils, stats, Matrix, data.table
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), knitr, rmarkdown, tibble, askpass, getPass, withr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
VignetteBuilder: knitr
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
